From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Topher Campbell <chrs2021@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 14/16] arm64: dts: mediatek: add the MT6771 and the Unihertz Titan Pocket

The MT6771 described on MT8183 bindings (same clocks, pinctrl, power
domains, display and camera subsystems, IOMMU larbs), and the Titan
Pocket board: display and panel, keyboard, touchpad, touchscreen, PMICs,
Type-C, charger, gauge, UFS, USB, audio, connectivity, NFC, sensors, cameras
(CAMSV1, ISP pass 2, the sensors' supplies and pins). The LK dtbo labels
let the bootloader's overlay apply.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/Makefile         |    3 +
 .../dts/mediatek/mt6771-lk-dtbo-labels.dtsi   |  210 ++
 .../mediatek/mt6771-unihertz-titan-pocket.dts | 1123 ++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6771.dtsi      | 1983 +++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 3319 insertions(+)

